  "Question": "A taxi charges 10 yuan for a trip of up to 3 km and 2 yuan per km beyond that. What function gives the fare \\(y\\) for a trip of \\(x\\) km (\\(x>3\\))? (Simplify to the form \\(y=kx+b\\).)",
